+==========
+Half Adder
+==========
+
+A half adder. Takes two inputs, ``i_a`` and ``i_b``, and adds them together to generate a sum output, ``o_sum``, 
+and a carry bit output, ``o_carry``.
+
+Inputs/Outputs
+--------------
+- ``i_a`` input a
+- ``i_b`` input b
+- ``o_sum`` output sum
+- ``o_carry`` output carry
+
+Implementation
+--------------
+.. literalinclude:: ../../src/math/halfadder/half_adder.sv
+    :language: systemverilog
+    :caption: half_adder.sv
+
+Block Diagram
+-------------
+
+.. figure:: svg/half_adder.svg
+    :align: center
+    :width: 100 %
+
+    half_adder.sv
